## Android SDK Location (configured by Android Studio or SDK manager)
## sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/Sdk

## Android Release Signing Configuration
## Required by 'com.hammadbawara.android.release-signing' convention plugin for release builds.
##
## Relative paths are resolved against the root project directory.
## Absolute paths (Unix or Windows) are also supported.
##
## IMPORTANT: NEVER commit local.properties or your keystore file to version control.
RELEASE_STORE_FILE=keystore/release.jks
RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD=example-store-password
RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=example-key-alias
RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=example-key-password
